{"abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"code":"enricher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/enriched(by:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"enricher","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"text":" runs, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"first"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sees what ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"text":" set and has the last word on a key both set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions()"},{"type":"text","text":" adds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") enricher calls for a batch of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" records.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/destination\/enriched(by:)"]}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"Destinations","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enriched.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Enriched.swift#L34"},"title":"enriched(by:)","externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationPAAE8enriched2byQr6Events8EnricherV_tF","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/destinations","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Where tracked events go: the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Destination","type":"code